    <worksheet name='KPI Summary'>
      <layout-options>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#555555'>GMV = Gross Merchandise Value (delivered orders only). AOV = Average Order Value</run>
            <run>

Total Orders, GMV, AOV, On-Time Delivery and Avg. Review Score. The context is filtered on State Full Name and Purchase Date. The State Full Name filter keeps multiple members. The Purchase Date filter ranges from 9/4/2016 to 8/31/2018.

</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
